HST Office About dialog: publisher contact, website, open-source notice.

- Removes the upstream "%PRODUCTNAME is derived from LibreOffice..." statement and
  the LibreOffice contributors copyright line, the Credits and Release Notes links,
  EXTRA_BUILDID in the Misc line and the build id link to the upstream repository
  (the build id stays in "Copy version info"). Adds a one-line open-source notice
  without any URL pointing to Help > License Information, where the licence document
  tells how to obtain the source; see hst-debrand.patch.
- Adds the publisher contact block (HASON TECH name, address, phone, e-mail,
  website), the same text in every UI language.
- Introductory texts are Vietnamese in every UI language (owner decision; menus and
  functions still follow the UI language): the description under the logo (no longer
  translatable in aboutdialog.ui) and the publisher line "Bản phát hành này do HASON TECH
  cung cấp." (was the translatable "This release was supplied by %OOOVENDOR.").
- Website button: Help/StartCenter/InfoURL now https://hasontech.vn/ (was a
  hard-coded https://www.libreoffice.org/ in postprocess/CustomTarget_registry.mk);
  no libreoffice.org language path is appended; UTM utm_medium=about.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).
